{"id":"wb-6-618","name":"尼山孔庙和书院","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T13:25:15+00:00","status":"ready","title":"尼山孔庙","text":"尼山孔庙是为纪念孔子诞生而在尼山所建的祭祀庙宇，位于山东曲阜。五代后周显德年间（公元954～959年）始建，明永乐十五年（1417年）重建，之后数次重修。现为全国重点文物保护单位。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%B0%BC%E5%B1%B1%E5%AD%94%E5%BA%99","revisionId":92194624,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=92194624","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"复核百科重定向、文物名称与同一地点；引用版本已锁定","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/22f7603e1d2218442162cc10.jpg","title":"Dachengdian,_Mount_Ni.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Dachengdian,_Mount_Ni.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/4/48/Dachengdian%2C_Mount_Ni.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"大禾花","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​尼山孔庙大成殿","width":320,"height":180,"matchEvidence":"已复核文物对应百科条目的主图","subject":"尼山孔庙"}}